	LINC			/THIS ROUTINE UNLOADS ALL THE TAPES
	LMODE			/EXCEPT FOR TAPE 0. IT IS SO SIMPLE
	SET I	AUTO7		/AND YET SO ELEGANT IT NEEDS
	-4			/NO COMMENTS. SO GAZE UPON IT AND BE THANKFUL.
	ADD	L20
UNLOOP,	ADA I
	-1
	AXO
	CHK I	U
	CHK I
	JMP	.-1
	XSK I	AUTO7
	JMP	UNLOOP
	CHK
UNPOS,	300
